# An allow-list: nothing goes into an image unless it is named here (T4.3, D60). The repository
# root also holds .env (secrets), names.txt and workplaces.txt (real names), scan-output/ and
# fixtures/; none of them may reach an image. CI checks the built images (docker/scan-image.sh).
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/shared/
!apps/api/
!apps/web/
!docker/Caddyfile

# Inside the allowed folders: build output, installed packages, generated code, tests, secrets.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env*
**/*.log
apps/api/src/generated
apps/api/test
apps/web/e2e
apps/web/test-results
apps/web/playwright-report
